SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Personal
SUMMARY:🕯️ David Ben-Gurion Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART:20261115T163000
DTEND:20261115T163000
UID:reminder-20261115-308720c8-3
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering David Ben-Gurion\, whose 53rd 
 Yahrzeit occurs on Monday\, November 16\, corresponding to the 6th of Kisl
 ev\, 5787.\n\nDavid Ben-Gurion’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Sunday\, 
 November 15 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is cu
 stomary to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay 
 your loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may th
 eir memory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Event reminder
TRIGGER:P0DT0H0M0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
