UID:reminder-20270724-c09d46fd-2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Theodor Herzl\, whose 123rd Ya
 hrzeit occurs on Sunday\, July 25\, corresponding to the 20th of Tamuz\, 5
 787.\n\nTheodor Herzl’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Saturday\, July 24
  and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to 
 light a memorial candle at nightfall as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your l
 oved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their me
 mory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
